/* Gn042: B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS degree 3x1: interior U-knot at u=0.5 with multiplicity=2; ShapeUpgrade_ConvertSurfaceToBezierBasis inserts knots to full multiplicity; patch at u=[0.5,0.5] collapses to zero parametric width (degenerate Bezier patch); extent filter fails to remove degenerate patch; output shell contains degenerate face; C-1 break in 3D edge at t=0.5 (1.5-unit CP gap) drives shape_null=True */
